    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+000C><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0006>라! 최고인걸!\n이걸로 다섯 마리가 모두 모였구나!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너는 어떤 포켓몬이든\n척척 데려오는구나! 고맙다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020101000C0010000219000006B77C00210020CD5CACE0C778AC780021000AC774AC78B85C0020B2E4C12F0020B9C8B9ACAC000020BAA8B4500020BAA8C600AD6CB098002100100001BE01000AB108B2940020C5B4B5A40020D3ECCF13BAACC774B4E0000ACC99CC990020B370B824C624B294AD6CB09800210020ACE0B9D9B2E4002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 추리 소설의 줄거리를 가르쳐 주마.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020CD94B9AC0020C18CC124C7580020C904AC70B9ACB97C0020AC00B974CCD00020C8FCB9C8002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무대는 칼로스지방의 깊은 산속,\n대부호 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>의 저택...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34B300B2940020CE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C7580020AE4AC7400020C0B0C18D002C000AB300BD80D63800200010000201020002C7580020C800D0DD002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그곳에 초대받은 세 손님과\n하나의 보물에 관한 이야기...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8ACF3C5D00020CD08B300BC1BC7400020C1380020C190B2D8ACFC000AD558B098C7580020BCF4BB3CC5D00020AD00D55C0020C774C57CAE30002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "현역 트레이너 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n저택에 초대를 받았다...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D604C5ED0020D2B8B808C774B108002000100002010200030010000219000001000AC800D0DDC5D00020CD08B300B97C0020BC1BC558B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대부호의 전 애인 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004>\n보석 컬렉터 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>도 마찬가지...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300BD80D638C7580020C8040020C560C778002000100002010200040010000219000004000ABCF4C11D0020CEECB809D13000200010000201020005B3C40020B9C8CC2CAC00C9C0002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대부호의 집사 <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n모두를 맞이하였고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300BD80D638C7580020C9D1C0AC002000100002018B00010010000219000001000ABAA8B450B97C0020B9DEC774D558C600ACE0002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대부호는 손님들을 한방으로 불렀다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300BD80D638B2940020C190B2D8B4E4C7440020D55CBC29C73CB85C0020BD88B800B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그곳은 방 자체가 거대한 금고로,\n‘분노의주먹’이라는 기술로도 부술 수 없다고<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n집사 <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 설명한다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8ACF3C7400020BC290020C790CCB4AC000020AC70B300D55C0020AE08ACE0B85C002C000A2018BD84B178C758C8FCBA392019C774B77CB2940020AE30C220B85CB3C40020BD80C2200020C2180020C5C6B2E4ACE000100001BE00000AC9D1C0AC002000100002018B000100100002190000010020C124BA85D55CB2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "방 중앙에 놓여 있는 것은\n보석 ‘<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0006>의 눈물’...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC290020C911C559C5D00020B193C5EC0020C788B2940020AC83C740000ABCF4C11D002020180010000201020006C7580020B208BB3C2019002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "과거 국왕이었던 AZ에게\n바쳐진 것이라고 전해지는 환상의 보석으로,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n대부호는 매일같이 감상하며 기운을 얻었다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACFCAC700020AD6DC655C774C5C8B35800200041005AC5D0AC8C000ABC14CCD0C9C40020AC83C774B77CACE00020C804D574C9C0B2940020D658C0C1C7580020BCF4C11DC73CB85C002C00100001BE00000AB300BD80D638B2940020B9E4C77CAC19C7740020AC10C0C1D558BA700020AE30C6B4C7440020C5BBC5C8B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음 날 아침... 대부호 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>의\n괴성이 저택 안에 울려 퍼졌다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74C0020B0A00020C544CE68002E002E002E0020B300BD80D63800200010000201020002C758000AAD34C131C7740020C800D0DD0020C548C5D00020C6B8B8240020D37CC84CB2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보석을 보관하는 방 앞에 모인\n손님들을 향해 대부호는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n보석을 도둑맞았다면서 이렇게 소리쳤다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C11DC7440020BCF4AD00D558B2940020BC290020C55EC5D00020BAA8C778000AC190B2D8B4E4C7440020D5A5D5740020B300BD80D638B29400100001BE00000ABCF4C11DC7440020B3C4B451B9DEC558B2E4BA74C11C0020C774B807AC8C0020C18CB9ACCCE4B2E4002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“손님들 중에 범인이 있는 게 분명해!”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201CC190B2D8B4E40020C911C5D00020BC94C778C7740020C788B2940020AC8C0020BD84BA85D5740021201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의심을 받은 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003> 물었다.\n“어째서 집사는 빼는 거지?”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C758C2ECC7440020BC1BC7400020001000020102000400100002190000030020BB3CC5C8B2E4002E000A201CC5B4C9F8C11C0020C9D1C0ACB2940020BE7CB2940020AC70C9C0003F201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대부호는 집사 <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004>는 아침까지\n카드 게임을 했으니 알리바이가 있다고 했다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300BD80D638B2940020C9D1C0AC002000100002018B00010010000219000004B2940020C544CE68AE4CC9C0000ACE74B4DC0020AC8CC784C7440020D588C73CB2C80020C54CB9ACBC14C774AC000020C788B2E4ACE00020D588B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의심을 받은 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004>\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n소지품과 신체를 확인해도 좋다고 말한다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C758C2ECC7440020BC1BC740002000100002010200030010000219000004000A0010000201020005001000021900000100100001BE00000AC18CC9C0D488ACFC0020C2E0CCB4B97C0020D655C778D574B3C40020C88BB2E4ACE00020B9D0D55CB2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "집사가 확인한 결과,\n트레이너인 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>의 볼 외에는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아무것도 나오지 않았고,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n보석은 여전히 찾지 못했다...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9D1C0ACAC000020D655C778D55C0020ACB0ACFC002C000AD2B8B808C774B108C77800200010000201020003C7580020BCFC0020C678C5D0B29400100001BE00000AC544BB34AC83B3C40020B098C624C9C00020C54AC558ACE0002C00100001BE00000ABCF4C11DC7400020C5ECC804D7880020CC3EC9C00020BABBD588B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 여기서 질문을 하마.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n보석 ‘<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0006>의 눈물’을 훔친\n범인이 누구인지 알겠니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020C5ECAE30C11C0020C9C8BB38C7440020D558B9C8002E00100001BE01000ABCF4C11D002020180010000201020006C7580020B208BB3C2019C7440020D6D4CE5C000ABC94C778C7740020B204AD6CC778C9C00020C54CACA0B2C8003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으음...\n트릭이 너무 어려웠나?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC74C002E002E002E000AD2B8B9ADC7740020B108BB340020C5B4B824C6E0B098003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호오!\n역시 대단하구나.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638C6240021000AC5EDC2DC0020B300B2E8D558AD6CB098002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬을 방에 풀어 두고\n아무도 없는 틈을 타 보석을 훔친 거란다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n호출을 받았을 때는 들키지 않게\n포켓몬을 몰래 몬스터볼에 넣은 거지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠냐?\n대담하고 치밀한 트릭이지?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0B0D0003F000AB300B2F4D558ACE00020CE58BC00D55C0020D2B8B9ADC774C9C0003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "걸작이네요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 5012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC78C791C774B124C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 뻔한 것 같은데요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 5028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020BED4D55C0020AC830020AC19C740B370C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "예상치 못한 맹점이라 할 수 있겠구나.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C608C0C1CE580020BABBD55C0020B9F9C810C774B77C0020D5600020C2180020C788ACA0AD6CB098002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 작품을 완성할 수 있었던 건\n전부 너의 아낌없는 협력 덕분이란다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 5108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C791D488C7440020C644C131D5600020C2180020C788C5C8B3580020AC74000AC804BD800020B108C7580020C544B08CC5C6B2940020D611B8250020B355BD84C774B780B2E4002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보답으로 포켓몬을 보여 주면\n지금까지의 걸작에 나온 인물들을 바꿔서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이야기를 들려주도록 하마!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4B2F5C73CB85C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCBA74000AC9C0AE08AE4CC9C0C7580020AC78C791C5D00020B098C6280020C778BB3CB4E4C7440020BC14AFD4C11C00100001BE00000AC774C57CAE30B97C0020B4E4B824C8FCB3C4B85D0020D558B9C8002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    }
  ],
